Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.29,0:01:35.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Spring was here at last.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:44.21,0:01:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, you broke it!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:45.92,0:01:46.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I did?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:46.83,0:01:48.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tired out already?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.96,0:01:50.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me? Not even close!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.13,0:01:51.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Keep at it!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.00,0:01:53.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Keep at it!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:51.00,0:01:53.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Everyone sure is going at it.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:53.08,0:01:54.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Keep at it!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.46,0:01:57.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,One, two! One, two! One, two!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:00.88,0:02:04.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You disgrace the Demonic Kingdom\Nwith your feebleness!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:04.83,0:02:06.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Give me ten more laps!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:06.04,0:02:07.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.33,0:02:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're sure hard at work.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:09.71,0:02:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Discipline fosters nobility, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:12.83,0:02:15.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why is everyone out exercising?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:15.25,0:02:17.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,For the martial arts competition, of course.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:17.67,0:02:20.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Even the girls from the town office\Nare taking part?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.33,0:02:24.00,Q2,,0,0,0,,Village Clerks
Dialogue: 1,0:02:20.71,0:02:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,They don't seem like fighters to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:24.21,0:02:29.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Holding power in the Demonic Kingdom\Nrequires martial prowess.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:29.13,0:02:30.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It does?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:30.46,0:02:31.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey! No slacking!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:31.96,0:02:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've been found.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:40.71,0:02:42.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's time to fight!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:42.00,0:02:43.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You got me...
Dialogue: 1,0:02:43.38,0:02:44.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:44.25,0:02:45.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,You gotta do it right!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:45.46,0:02:46.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hrngh!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:46.88,0:02:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone seems excited\Nabout the competition.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:50.38,0:02:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Seven hundred and one!\NSeven hundred and two!
Dialogue: 1,0:02:53.13,0:02:55.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm headed home to train.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:55.21,0:02:56.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 1,0:02:56.50,0:02:59.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I haven't used my full strength\Nsince coming here,
Dialogue: 1,0:02:59.29,0:03:00.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,so I need some practice.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:01.21,0:03:02.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was you out of practice?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:02.46,0:03:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Far from my best.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:06.17,0:03:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,If she used her full strength...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:08.38,0:03:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Blaargh!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:10.50,0:03:11.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Actually!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:12.67,0:03:15.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We need a referee for the event,
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.17,0:03:17.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and I don't know a thing\Nabout martial arts.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:17.63,0:03:18.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that sounds boring-
Dialogue: 1,0:03:18.83,0:03:21.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The referee needs to be strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:21.54,0:03:24.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Someone who can show everyone\Nwhat true strength is!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:24.67,0:03:27.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess you have a point.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:27.38,0:03:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:28.88,0:03:30.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm headed home to train.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:30.88,0:03:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Roooar!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:32.21,0:03:33.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Baaah!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:34.21,0:03:36.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need two referees!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:36.63,0:03:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Two experts!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:38.88,0:03:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only two truly skilled fighters\Ncan be referees!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:42.75,0:03:43.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good point!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:43.67,0:03:44.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Makes sense.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.79,0:03:46.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Great! Counting on you!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:46.29,0:03:47.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I still want to fight.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.67,0:03:49.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:49.21,0:03:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,We settled on having them as referees\Nwith their own mock battle.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:54.79,0:03:57.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why the creepy laugh?
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.04,0:04:00.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll finally be able to punch you again, Tia.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:00.83,0:04:06.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, Lulucy, has your fist ever\Nreached me even once before?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:06.04,0:04:07.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hasn't it?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.21,0:04:09.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nthey did say they were rivals.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.92,0:04:11.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nthey did say they were rivals.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:09.92,0:04:11.13,Q1,,0,0,0,,You just ate one.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.13,0:04:12.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,\Nthey did say they were rivals.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:11.13,0:04:12.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Did I?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.17,0:04:12.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Did I?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:12.79,0:04:14.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,There, there.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.42,0:04:16.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things sure are getting violent, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.29,0:04:18.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're not joining in?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:18.29,0:04:22.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll act as healer for\Nanyone who gets injured.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.04,0:04:22.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd want to blow things up.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd want to blow things up.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Witness the greatest explosion ever!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:24.33,0:04:25.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Witness the greatest explosion ever!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.63,0:04:28.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Explosives aren't meant for people.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:28.38,0:04:29.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,On that we agree...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:30.38,0:04:36.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We should make an arena where all our\Nresidents and guests can watch and enjoy.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:37.33,0:04:40.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll have a stage and stadium seating.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:40.50,0:04:43.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's make space for shops\Nand restaurants too.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:43.88,0:04:46.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,They'll be able to watch and eat?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.71,0:04:48.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,How fancy.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.33,0:04:50.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll have to think up some\Ngood festival food.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:52.58,0:04:54.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Refreshing.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:55.46,0:04:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Before long, the day was here.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:05.25,0:05:06.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.33,0:05:07.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:09.83,0:05:13.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for inviting us here this day.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, been a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.92,0:05:18.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is my father.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.71,0:05:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The name is Galgardo.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:20.63,0:05:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Titular Demon Lord of the\NDemonic Kingdom of Galgardo.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:23.96,0:05:25.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The Demon Lord?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.13,0:05:28.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What should I do?\NI don't know their customs...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:28.21,0:05:31.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Father, we need no excessive formalities.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.04,0:05:32.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Right, yes.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:32.63,0:05:35.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am Yuri's dad. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.58,0:05:37.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you for joining us.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.58,0:05:40.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I hope my daughters\Naren't causing you trouble.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.38,0:05:41.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, of course not.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.79,0:05:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's soft-spoken,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.58,0:05:47.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,but he's important back in his kingdom\Nand must be pretty strong.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:48.33,0:05:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:50.13,0:05:51.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You must be the mayor.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:51.96,0:05:54.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am. And you are...?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.33,0:05:55.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,This here's my father.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.96,0:05:57.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And my grandfather!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.75,0:05:59.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Which means...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the Emperor Dragon?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.42,0:06:03.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing more than an honorary title.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.92,0:06:05.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can call me Doze.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.42,0:06:06.33,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sir Doze, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.33,0:06:06.67,Q1,,0,0,0,,Sir Doze, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.33,0:06:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that truly the legendary dragon who...?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.17,Q1,,0,0,0,,Simply Doze.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:06.67,0:06:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that truly the legendary dragon who...?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:08.17,0:06:09.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that truly the legendary dragon who...?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes. Now say no more.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.92,0:06:12.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,And with you?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:12.92,0:06:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, this? He's the Demon Lord.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.17,0:06:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, really?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.38,0:06:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup. Yuri's father.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:19.58,0:06:22.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,So you lead the Demonic Kingdom?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.00,0:06:23.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.67,0:06:25.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,That I do.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:26.54,0:06:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you all for gathering with us.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:30.04,0:06:34.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We will now begin the Great Tree Village's\Nfirst martial arts competition.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.79,0:06:39.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This should be good.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:39.75,0:06:41.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-Indeed.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone sure is excited.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.25,0:06:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is the largest event\Nwe've ever held, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:47.58,0:06:51.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You know, this was supposed to be\Nseating for our guests.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:51.21,0:06:53.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is better. Just sit with confidence.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:54.42,0:06:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, uhhh, try not to get hurt\Nout there, everyone.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.63,0:07:01.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,The crowd went wild.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.71,0:07:02.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm getting nervous. Let's do our best!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.21,0:07:04.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,I'm getting nervous. Let's do our best!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:02.21,0:07:04.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,And we started with our first half\Nwhere anyone could join.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.13,0:07:06.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The rules were simple.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:06.79,0:07:09.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They'd draw lots for one-on-one battles.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.83,0:07:11.46,Q2,,0,0,0,,Open Tournament Rules
Dialogue: 1,0:07:09.21,0:07:12.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,To win, you had to either\Nknock your opponent out of the ring,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.46,0:07:14.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,or we'd decide based on their headbands.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:14.83,0:07:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,They were infused with protective magic
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.92,0:07:20.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,and would unravel whenever\Na decisive blow was landed.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:20.96,0:07:25.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The first round pit the clerk Rosalind\Nagainst the beastwoman Mamu.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:26.13,0:07:27.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:27.38,0:07:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Set...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.88,0:07:29.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.42,0:07:41.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, a real fight, right from the start.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:42.00,0:07:45.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for thinking they'd just be\Nswinging sticks around.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.25,0:08:03.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,The winner is Rosalind!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.25,0:08:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'd like to see the healer...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:08.46,0:08:11.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ooo, you've taken some serious damage.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:11.04,0:08:13.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh my gosh, I'm really sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.21,0:08:14.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:14.46,0:08:17.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Paging all combatants!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:17.08,0:08:21.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can handle broken limbs,\Nbut reattaching things is harder work.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:21.25,0:08:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,so please refrain from tearing anything off!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.63,0:08:25.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,What a terrifying announcement.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:32.58,0:08:35.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hmph. Was that all?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:35.21,0:08:36.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:37.46,0:08:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Donovan wins!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:39.00,0:08:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.79,0:08:45.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Give it thirty more years and you'll be great.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.00,0:08:48.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's hardly enough to stop an elder dwarf.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:48.58,0:08:51.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,They walked through the\Nmonster-infested woods to get here.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:51.88,0:08:52.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.75,0:08:55.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,More of them have shown up since, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.17,0:08:56.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,I heard you have alcohol here.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:56.63,0:08:58.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure took your time.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.50,0:09:02.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Prepare to face Gruwald Raby Coll!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.54,0:09:04.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,No! Stay away!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:05.38,0:09:06.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:06.71,0:09:08.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Roaju wins!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.00,0:09:10.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I ran too far?!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:10.75,0:09:12.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hiyah!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:18.38,0:09:19.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The winner.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.75,0:09:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Accomplishment.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:21.04,0:09:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,There were some more peaceful battles.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:26.29,0:09:29.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The final battle of the open tournament\Nwas between Flow and Sena.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:30.96,0:09:33.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Flow was using a sword and magic.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.79,0:09:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,But Sena was... bare handed?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.29,0:09:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Flow! You look so cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.08,0:09:45.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Make us proud!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.58,0:09:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm your biggest fan!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:46.79,0:09:48.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:48.17,0:09:49.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Powers of the wind!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:12.08,0:10:13.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get her!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.17,0:10:14.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:13.17,0:10:14.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.29,0:10:14.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:15.21,0:10:19.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're much more aggressive than usual.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:20.46,0:10:22.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Since when was Sena a grappler?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,F-L-O-W! You're amazing!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,F-L-O-W! You're amazing!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:24.79,0:10:27.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,There! Finish her!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.08,0:10:32.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:32.67,0:10:33.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,She grabbed her back?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.29,0:10:36.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:36.29,0:10:37.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aaah!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:38.58,0:10:39.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uhhh...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:40.79,0:10:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,They both fell together, so...\Nthat's a tie!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:45.63,0:10:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What an excellent fight.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.58,0:10:50.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,That concludes the open tournament.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.58,0:10:51.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.92,0:10:54.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your battles were more impressive\Nthan I imagined.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:54.79,0:10:58.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,The winners were given honorary medals.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.38,0:11:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Please give another round of applause\Nfor our brave combatants.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.67,0:11:02.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was awesome!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:01.67,0:11:02.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Flow...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.71,0:11:03.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You were so cool!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:02.71,0:11:03.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.71,0:11:04.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,You almost won!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:03.71,0:11:04.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ahhh...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.79,0:11:08.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,But that was only the first half.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:09.08,0:11:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder what the warrior\Ntournament will be like.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:11.96,0:11:16.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hang on, I don't see\Nthe mayor's name on the list.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.71,0:11:20.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shh, I'm sure it's supposed to be a secret.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:20.63,0:11:23.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, I almost spoiled the surprise.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.38,0:11:26.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not some secret\Nunlockable character, okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:28.63,0:11:32.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,We will now begin the warrior tournament!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:32.88,0:11:35.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Things were simpler in this half.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:35.29,0:11:37.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Winners would emerge when one party\Nwas knocked out or gave up.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:37.96,0:11:40.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,There were no restrictions on weapons.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:40.00,0:11:43.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Only those capable of fighting\Nunder these rules were allowed in.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.17,0:11:47.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,They'd fight according to a tournament\Nbracket with the first battle between
Dialogue: 1,0:11:45.29,0:11:51.92,Q2,,0,0,0,,Warrior Tournament Round 1
Dialogue: 1,0:11:47.34,0:11:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uno the inferno wolf
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.59,0:11:51.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,and Junea the lamia.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:54.50,0:11:55.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.92,0:11:58.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's one-on-one this time...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.42,0:12:00.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,She seems pained.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.88,0:12:04.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,The wolves did nearly exterminate\Nher people, after all.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.79,0:12:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, that was my fault.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:08.96,0:12:11.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let the battle begin!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:21.29,0:12:22.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:22.38,0:12:24.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's making full use of her form.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.88,0:12:29.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is what I had long trained for.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.25,0:12:30.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you concede?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.29,0:12:43.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:43.54,0:12:45.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I concede!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.92,0:12:49.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never knew they could do that.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.00,0:12:54.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Stories of a single inferno wolf\Ndestroying entire towns might be true.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:54.42,0:12:56.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uno wins!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:57.96,0:13:01.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The next round pitted Daga the lizardman
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.42,0:13:06.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,against one of Zabuton's offspring, Makura.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:07.29,0:13:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,You want to join?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.25,0:13:13.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, but we can't just call you\N"Zabuton's offspring" then.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:13.71,0:13:15.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,You need a name...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:15.83,0:13:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're rounder, so maybe "Makura,"\Nwhich means pillow?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.92,0:13:22.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, I take it you like it.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.08,0:13:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hup!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:26.71,0:13:27.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hiyah!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.25,0:13:29.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It just keeps running.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.75,0:13:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Daga has the upper hand.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.46,0:13:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.71,0:13:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,There's nowhere left to run...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am defeated.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.50,0:13:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The winner is Makura!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:46.54,0:13:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I stood no chance...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.08,0:13:51.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Should it be that strong?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:51.50,0:13:52.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Good luck!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:52.50,0:13:53.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.67,0:13:55.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next, round three!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.79,0:14:01.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ya the mountain elf versus\Nour guest from Howling Village, Garf!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:02.71,0:14:04.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.71,0:14:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.21,0:14:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Brace yourself.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:16.38,0:14:18.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,This looks easy for Garf.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:18.92,0:14:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,He seems pretty composed.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:21.00,0:14:23.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's the greatest warrior\Nin Howling Village!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.96,0:14:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Must be hard to face him\Nwith a weapon like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:28.79,0:14:31.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It puts her at a disadvantage.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.17,0:14:33.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Which leaves her only one option.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:34.46,0:14:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,A single strike charged with magic!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.25,0:14:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hiyaaah!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:46.71,0:14:47.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oop!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:47.63,0:14:50.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whew, that was close.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:50.50,0:14:53.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww, I didn't hit him at the right angle!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.33,0:14:56.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ya gave up, making Garf\Nthe winner of round three.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.79,0:14:58.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go get 'em!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:58.08,0:14:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next was round four.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:59.67,0:15:00.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Next...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:01.50,0:15:04.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Representing the high elves is Lea.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:05.17,0:15:08.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her opponent, the angel Granmaria!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:09.13,0:15:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The rules will be altered this round.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:11.25,0:15:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Falling from the stage\Nwill no longer end the match.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:13.88,0:15:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That wouldn't be fair when one can fly.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.83,0:15:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're not using your usual weapon?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.25,0:15:20.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:20.67,0:15:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would be unable to hold back\Nif I used my spear.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.92,0:15:26.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm quite fine facing your full force.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:27.50,0:15:29.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.04,0:15:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.38,0:15:45.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,You do well hiding yourself. However...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:49.46,0:15:51.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,from up above, all is clear...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:58.04,0:15:59.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hiyah!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:07.58,0:16:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well? Care to concede?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.83,0:16:12.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Never!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:12.50,0:16:16.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,You may have thought pinning someone\Nsmall like me would earn you the win.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:16.33,0:16:20.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,But your entire weight is not\Nhalf that of my spear!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:24.21,0:16:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now you're just being rash!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:27.04,0:16:28.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fine then!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:38.13,0:16:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Which of us is rash now?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:42.67,0:16:46.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is stand and I win.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:49.33,0:16:51.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I can't...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:53.67,0:16:55.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is that a tie?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:55.46,0:16:57.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was an epic battle.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.13,0:17:03.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the truly epic battles had not yet begun.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.96,0:17:04.13,Q2,,0,0,0,,Warrior Tournament Round 5
Dialogue: 1,0:17:04.21,0:17:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't hold back now.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.33,0:17:08.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course not...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.04,0:17:10.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Begin...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:11.79,0:17:13.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tia wins!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.21,0:17:15.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oww! No one can beat that!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:15.46,0:17:17.38,Q2,,0,0,0,,Warrior Tournament Round 6
Dialogue: 1,0:17:17.46,0:17:19.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Come on then.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:19.21,0:17:20.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm done for...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:20.46,0:17:21.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Begin...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.92,0:17:24.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The winner is Lu!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:25.46,0:17:27.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I thought I was done for.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.79,0:17:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:28.88,0:17:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's finally time!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:30.58,0:17:33.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need to record my sister\Nin all her gallant glory!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.50,0:17:36.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay for our healer\Nto be up here?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.13,0:17:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:36.96,0:17:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,She'll never get hurt.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.33,0:17:40.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,She won't?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:45.00,0:17:47.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lu!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.04,0:17:56.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Shall we then?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:57.50,0:17:58.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:58.96,0:18:00.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:01.79,0:18:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:07.33,0:18:08.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.46,0:18:10.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:10.83,0:18:13.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't even understand\Nwhat's going on!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:13.38,0:18:15.08,Q1,,0,0,0,,Lu! Lu! Lu!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,Lu! Lu! Lu!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:15.08,0:18:17.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is everyone else following along?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.21,0:18:17.92,Q1,,0,0,0,,Lu! Lu! Lu!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Lu! Lu! Lu!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:17.92,0:18:19.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay then...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:24.54,0:18:26.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.42,0:18:31.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This spear really does\Nboost my physical abilities.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:31.75,0:18:34.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,My eyes can now just barely keep up.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.71,0:18:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is incredible!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.17,0:18:44.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,There! Blow her up!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:44.67,0:18:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.92,0:18:53.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:56.21,0:18:57.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just like I said.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.67,0:18:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Finally able to punch you again.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:00.08,0:19:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, let's have it then!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:04.96,0:19:06.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oof...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.21,0:19:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take that!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.58,0:19:09.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're really going at it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:09.21,0:19:10.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:10.33,0:19:12.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,They look like they're having fun, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.21,0:19:13.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,If this were a shonen manga,\Nthey'd become good friends after this.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,If this were a shonen manga,\Nthey'd become good friends after this.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,You're not half bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If this were a shonen manga,\Nthey'd become good friends after this.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.71,0:19:16.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,I could say the same.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.67,0:19:17.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:17.88,0:19:18.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,How dare I what?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.79,0:19:19.00,Q1,,0,0,0,,How dare I what?!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:18.79,0:19:19.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe these punches come from\Na place of friendship...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.00,0:19:21.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Ow! We're supposed to take turns!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:19.00,0:19:21.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe these punches come from\Na place of friendship...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.83,0:19:22.42,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't remember that rule!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.83,0:19:22.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe these punches come from\Na place of friendship...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:22.42,0:19:23.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,I don't remember that rule!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.29,0:19:31.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sheesh.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:31.79,0:19:33.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's not fair!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.96,0:19:34.21,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's just not fair!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.21,0:19:35.88,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's just not fair!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.21,0:19:35.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The winner is Tia.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:35.88,0:19:36.58,Q1,,0,0,0,,It's just not fair!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:37.17,0:19:39.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess that does it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:39.04,0:19:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Darling!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.46,0:19:42.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tia is being mean to me!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:42.58,0:19:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oof! Oww! It hurts! Oww!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.42,0:19:46.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oof! Oww! It hurts! Oww!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.42,0:19:46.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,You can't pull that now!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:46.79,0:19:50.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,After a phenomenal battle,\NTia beat Lu.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:51.17,0:19:53.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,And her opponent in\Nthe final round was...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:57.04,0:19:58.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:58.79,0:20:01.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not cut out for this!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:01.79,0:20:04.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This takes me back.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:05.79,0:20:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Makura, congratulations on winning\Nthe warrior tournament.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:09.92,0:20:12.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,The prize is this crown, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's where you're going to wear it?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:17.25,0:20:19.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,We didn't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.13,0:20:23.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank you all once again.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:24.21,0:20:26.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll say just one thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.50,0:20:29.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Each battle was tremendous.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:29.08,0:20:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go now and rest-
Dialogue: 1,0:20:31.21,0:20:32.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,What about our turn?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:32.96,0:20:34.71,Q1,,0,0,0,,Boo! Boo!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:34.71,0:20:37.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,We want to battle!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:37.21,0:20:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:38.83,0:20:44.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,To close us off, our referees\Nwill hold a mock battle.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:47.88,0:20:49.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here I go!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.58,0:20:51.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bring it on!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:06.13,0:21:10.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Word is the explosion was visible\Nfrom the Demonic Kingdom.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:13.88,0:21:18.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,The shops were blown away,\Nbut at least we have our drink!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.63,0:21:19.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:19.88,0:21:22.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's the one who went all out.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:22.75,0:21:24.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like you didn't.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.38,0:21:26.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You could at least hold back.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.21,0:21:27.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Me too!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:26.21,0:21:27.46,Q1,,0,0,0,,I did.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.46,0:21:28.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold back more, then.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:28.79,0:21:30.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm the one who gave them the go ahead.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:31.17,0:21:33.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hakuren won the round.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:33.21,0:21:34.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,You need more practice.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:34.42,0:21:35.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Waaah!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:36.25,0:21:39.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I did see Lasty land an explosive uppercut.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:39.67,0:21:42.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wonder if her blind spot is down below?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:42.63,0:21:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's been a long time\Nsince a battle has riled me up!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.75,0:21:48.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Care to take me on in battle, Demon Lord?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.83,0:21:51.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're too funny.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:51.13,0:21:55.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Despite it all, things went quite well.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:55.42,0:21:56.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yup.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:56.96,0:21:59.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,If you want to call this going well.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:00.13,0:22:02.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone had a good time, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:02.38,0:22:04.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's good enough for a festival.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.17,0:22:09.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,We'll need to rethink the structural integrity,\Nbut when will we host the next one?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:09.88,0:22:10.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Uhhh...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.21,0:22:15.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think I'm good for a while...
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.33,0:23:50.92,Q5,,0,0,0,,Another Peaceful Day
Dialogue: 1,0:23:47.33,0:23:50.92,Q4,,0,0,0,,Episode 5
